## User question:
How to configure Huawei router BGP in VPNv4 address family to calculate route preference using the sum of MED multiplied by 500 and IGP cost multiplied by 200?
---
## Proposed answer:
ipv4-family vpnv4
bgp 65001
peer 10.0.0.2 distribute-list out MED_WEIGHT
exit
ip prefix-list MED_WEIGHT seq 5 permit 0.0.0.0/0
route-policy MED_WEIGHT permit node 10
if-match med
apply cost multiply 500
exit
route-policy MED_WEIGHT permit node 20
if-match igp-cost
apply cost multiply 200
exit
