{'Parameters': 'threshold threshold-value', 'Info': 'Specifies a slow peer detection threshold. If the difference between the time taken to send packets to BGP peer 1 and the shortest time taken to send packets to BGP peer 2 is greater than the threshold, BGP peer 1 is considered as a slow peer.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 120 to 3600, in seconds. The default value is 300.'}
