{'Parameters': 'both', 'Info': 'Enables the RR to receive Add-Path routes from and send Add-Path routes to a specified IBGP peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'receive', 'Info': 'Enables the RR to receive Add-Path routes from a specified IBGP peer.\n-'}
