{'Parameters': 'vpnv6', 'Info': 'Sets the type of RIB-in or RIB-out route whose statistics are to be sent by the BMP device to the monitoring server in the VPNv6 address family.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'pre-policy', 'Info': 'Sends statistics about all received routes to the monitoring server.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'post-policy', 'Info': 'Sends statistics about only accepted routes to the monitoring server.\n-'}
