How to configure Huawei router's BGP MVPN to detect peers with packet transmission delays exceeding 500 seconds compared to the fastest peer?
---
## Proposed answer:
mpls ldp
mpls ldp router-id 1.1.1.1
mpls ldp traffic-engineering
mpls ldp traffic-engineering bandwidth 10000000
mpls ldp traffic-engineering metric 100
mpls ldp traffic-engineering delay 500
bgp 100
peer 2.2.2.2 enable
peer 2.2.2.2 connect-interface Loopback0
peer 2.2.2.2 next-hop-local
peer 2.2.2.2 route-policy TEST out
route-policy TEST permit node 10
if-match delay exceed 500
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
