## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to ensure BGP updates sent to peer 192.168.5.5 replace all private AS numbers in the AS_Path with the local AS number while preserving the peer's private AS number?
---
## Proposed answer:
peer 192.168.5.5 replace-as
---
## Router configuration manual:
